ext{i}.$ We multiply both the numerator and the denominator by $-2-3\\text{i},$ so that the denominator turns into a real number:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{5\\text{i}}{-2+3\\text{i}} & =\\frac{5\\text{i}}{-2+3\\text{i}}\\cdot \\frac{-2-3\\text{i}}{-2-3\\text{i}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-10\\text{i}-15{\\text{i}}^{2}}{(-2)^{2}-(3\\text{i})^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-10\\text{i}-15(-1)}{4-(-9)} \\\\  & =\\frac{15-10\\text{i}}{13}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow that the denominator is a real number, we can write the complex number in the form $a+b\\text{i}:$\n\n$$\n\\frac{15-10\\text{i}}{13}=(\\frac{15}{13})+(-\\frac{10}{13})\\,\\text{i}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037457/state.json" "file_sha256" "58f5edaf06cd6791fd9538b3fe60824e8e81fbf9036f0d7e894a6e906346c178"} {"question" "q-316851" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037457/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "c494780e4970659270872b5cd5b1ab0e6be9b4fef0c02cbecb5ab0822ce4b831"} {"question" "q-316851" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037457/state.json" "file_sha256" "58f5edaf06cd6791fd9538b3fe60824e8e81fbf9036f0d7e894a6e906346c178"} {"question" "q-316851" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{15}{13}"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037457/state.json" "file_sha256" "58f5edaf06cd6791fd9538b3fe60824e8e81fbf9036f0d7e894a6e906346c178"} {"question" "q-316851" "field" "field-2" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category"